{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"c51d4fcea2dc758f2285b13c1a20429808d8801cd30accb79d1627c22b86b3f7","digest":{"component_or_area":"completion verifier / evidence banking","key_entities":["CompletionEvidencePolicy.fallback_record","CriterionBank.upsert","CriterionBank.record_insufficient","record_criterion_verdict","harvest_structured_into_bank","completion_verdict.schema.json","evidence_sufficient marker","reconcile_verdict","merge_finalizer_with_bank","assemble_deterministic_verdict","_render_verdict_text","close_precheck","completion_sidecar","completion_verdict_assembly.py"],"problem_keywords":["completion verifier","evidence exhaustion","false fail verdict","absence of evidence","tri-state verdict","search budget","bounded fallback"],"propositions":["At search exhaustion, the verifier incorrectly banks met=false (refutation) when evidence exists but the search budget ran out, misattributing absence-of-evidence as evidence-of-absence and producing false FAIL verdicts","The fix introduces a tri-state evidence outcome (met, refuted, insufficient) carried via optional evidence_sufficient:false marker alongside met=false, preserving backward compatibility for fail-closed consumers","The marker is written only by the framework (bounded fallback calls CriterionBank.record_insufficient) and preserved across re-harvest by overwrite logic, while genuine refutations (bare met=false from model) clear it","All consumer seams (schema validation, verdict assembly, renderers, close-gate, sidecar) are updated to distinguish insufficient evidence from unmet criteria in both logic gates and user-facing messages"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787315186164242001,"uuid":"75c2e1d4-e0e0-4f69-86d6-4cfcc9547924"}